  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Political and economical analysis Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to explore opportunities and challenges related to the engagement of Dutch businesses in the greenhouses sector in Egypt. Dutch engagement in this sector has the potential to deliver win-win outcomes, in terms of supporting the development of Egypt&#x2019;s agricultural sector in spite of water scarcity, for example through the transfer of relevant technology, while also creating opportunities for Dutch businesses. A complete analysis of the main opportunities and challenges offered by this sector is crucial for the Dutch engagement to achieve its desired goals. This project seeks to provide such analysis, including concrete recommendations on how to maximize the benefits of Dutch engagement, while at the same time mitigating risks.</narrative>
  </description>
